{"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/s16SendableMetatypeP","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/7SwiftUI4ViewP"],"kind":"relationships","type":"conformsTo"}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/misocomponents\/misolistitemicon"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"sections":[],"kind":"symbol","topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/init(status:description:size:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/body"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"title":"Enumerations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/IconStatus","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/Size"],"anchor":"Enumerations","generated":true},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/View-Implementations","doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/View-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"platforms":["macOS"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"attribute","text":"@"},{"kind":"attribute","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","text":"MainActor"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"struct"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"MISOListItemIcon"}]}]},{"content":[{"text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"overview","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" displays a status icon (info, warning, positive, negative) with a predefined asset,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"or a custom neutral icon from a provided image. Each icon type has a semantic color applied automatically"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"based on the current theme."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"An optional notification badge can be attached to neutral icons to indicate additional status."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Status","level":2,"anchor":"Status","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/IconStatus","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the available icon variants:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".neutral(asset:badge:)"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A custom icon from a provided "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Image"},{"type":"text","text":" asset, rendered with the default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"content color. An optional notification badge (small dot) can be displayed at the top-trailing corner."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".positive"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A predefined checkmark\/confirmation icon with a positive (green) semantic color."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".info"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A predefined information icon with an informational (blue) semantic color."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".warning"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A predefined warning icon with a warning (yellow\/orange) semantic color."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This icon uses a two-layer rendering with distinct internal and external shape colors."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".negative"}]},{"type":"text","text":": A predefined alert\/important icon with a negative (red) semantic color."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"text":"Sizes","level":2,"anchor":"Sizes","type":"heading"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/MISOComponents\/documentation\/MISOComponents\/MISOListItemIcon\/Size","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" enum defines the available sizes:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".medium"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The default size, corresponding to the theme’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"controlItem.sizeAssetMedium"},{"type":"text","text":" token."}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":".large"}]},{"type":"text","text":": The largest size, corresponding to the theme’s "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"controlItem.sizeAssetLarge"},{"type":"text","text":" token."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}],"type":"unorderedList"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"text":"Note:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"text","text":" When the icon is embedded in a list item with small size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"(via "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"SwiftUI\/View\/misoListItemSize(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), the icon is always rendered at its smallest size"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"regardless of the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"size"},{"type":"text","text":" parameter."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"Code samples","level":2,"anchor":"Code-samples","type":"heading"},{"syntax":"swift","code":["    \/\/ Info icon with medium size (default)","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .info, description: \"Something new\")","","    \/\/ Warning icon with large size","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .warning, description: \"Mobile data almost used\", size: .large)","","    \/\/ Negative icon with medium size","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .negative, description: \"Payment failed\", size: .medium)","","    \/\/ Custom neutral icon without badge","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .neutral(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), descritpion: \"Emails\"))","","    \/\/ Custom neutral icon with notification badge","    MISOListItemIcon(status: .neutral(asset: Image(decorative: \"ic_heart\"), description: \"New emails received\", badge: true))","","    \/\/ Usage as leading element in a list item","    MISOStaticListItem(","        data: MISOListItemData(label: \"Information\"),","        leading: .icon(MISOListItemIcon(status: .info, description: \"\", size: .medium))","    )","","    \/\/ Usage as trailing element in a list item","    MISOStaticListItem(","        data: MISOListItemData(label: \"Warning\"),","        trailing: .icon(MISOListItemIcon(status: .warning, description: \"\", size: .medium))","    )"],"type":"codeListing"},{"style":"note","content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"OUDS 3.0.0","type":"text"}]}],"name":"Since","type":"aside"}],"kind":"content"}],"metadata":{"symbolKind":"struct","externalID":"s:14MISOComponents16MISOListItemIconV","platforms":[{"introducedAt":"15.0","name":"iOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"13.0","name":"macOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"16.0","name":"tvOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"1.0","name":"visionOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false},{"introducedAt":"11.0","name":"watchOS","unavailable":false,"deprecated":false,"beta":false}],"roleHeading":"Structure","role":"symbol","title":"MI